WEBVTT

00:07:59.246 --> 00:08:03.196
Of course, not all experiments work.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.276
Jos tried a similar approach
to the fire service

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:09.837
and found it didn't work because
the service is just too centralized.

00:08:09.861 --> 00:08:12.424
Failed experiments look inefficient,

00:08:12.448 --> 00:08:15.631
but they're often the only way
you can figure out

00:08:15.655 --> 00:08:17.929
how the real world works.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:21.313
So now he's trying teachers.

00:08:22.746 --> 00:08:26.493
Experiments like that require creativity

00:08:26.517 --> 00:08:28.824
and not a little bravery.

00:08:29.613 --> 00:08:31.176
In England --